# AI page. Never type a real API key. Only a keyless Ollama model may be added.
ipc panels settings ai
wait 2
shot ai-top
note AI1 same groups, rows, details and footers as QML (check in each look).
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 20
wait 1
shot ai-mid
note AI1 middle of the page as QML.
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 40
wait 1
shot ai-end
note AI1 end including the Sidebar part as QML.
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 -80
wait 1
ptr move 1330 400 sleep 200 glide 1330 400 100 click
wait 1
shot ai-provider
note AI2 Provider list open. Position is a guess: read from ai-top. List must match QML (rows, widths).
key -k Escape
wait 1
# MANUAL: AI2 pick Custom: Authentication and API base URL rows appear; Google Vertex AI: Authentication options, detail "Gemini models on Vertex AI"; OAuth access token: project/location rows and credential label "OAuth access token"; Ollama: credential row gone, base URL placeholder "<ollamaUrl>/v1"
# MANUAL: AI3 Provider OpenAI, type gpt-4o in Model ID: "Reads pictures" flips as the QML while typing
# MANUAL: AI4 clear Model ID, Add model: red status text; Ollama + ID test-model: "Model saved and selected." and in Your models; remove: "test-model removed" + Undo; Undo brings it back; remove again, wait 8 s, Undo row goes
# MANUAL: AI5 click the note, type 650 characters: the field holds 600, detail "600 of 600" (batch 3: cut on screen too)
# MANUAL: AI6 Delete all chats (greyed with no chats: shot it); if chats exist click once, then Space cancels the question (focus on Keep chats; not done in Rust)
# MANUAL: AI7 start the delete question or type in Display name, go to another page and back: empty form, no question
ipc panels settings accounts
wait 2
ipc panels settings ai
wait 2
shot ai-reset
note AI7 back on the AI page after leaving: forms empty and no question open, same as QML.
ipc panels close
